msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Yep, so it is..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Eh oui..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_3B09AAB0_11F7_4DC2_8A1E_301630E77B6D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6cee13b6db8ff6224b5e5f66f68a55b2ca093a7dc4c57b3b7cdb95510dc008bd
#. default-sha256: 8ce343d11e20529a0681e89d81190cd3cf971a741d8f6c999802acac97604e13
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3B09AAB0_11F7_4DC2_8A1E_301630E77B6D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It’s amazing how... ⟪k:1⟫little there is.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫No big yard, no paintings, no vases "
"filled with colorful flowers,⟪k:4⟫no silver bowls full of fresh-picked fruit..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’est fou comme... ⟪k:1⟫c’est petit.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Pas de grand jardin, pas de tableaux, pas de "
"vases remplis de fleurs de toutes les couleurs, pas de bols en argent débordant de fruits frais..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_56069B73_DD4D_4AD7_946C_E8F53FDA49CA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bbead37ad23e13227561d9235dd685e12b0a04b8cea92fb34da666381a5c305a
#. default-sha256: 89365a25c06514b955b5ecd1b368cb24a744486ef576c331c8b6617202f7bc7d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_56069B73_DD4D_4AD7_946C_E8F53FDA49CA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I’ll do whatever I can for you, dearest Mell.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Are you hungry? I’m hungry."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Je ferai tout ce que je peux pour toi, mon très cher Mell.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Tu as faim ? J’ai "
"faim."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D2D83A47_3DEB_471B_8B8A_BEC74F5135A1
