#: scenario8:scenario8_9595E7DE_C5BA_4AE0_81B9_A11C331F0E2D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 945b5b02dcdfb11150590389428c4d33c7061ef1e3ffaea9e7d1211d4af6043d
