#: scenario8:scenario8_276FC91D_6FDC_4871_B020_4A14D8E5C672
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5294ea6b8c65e170cf490f379193086fd8cb84582522deced2d734f5bbc59097
