msgid "⟪k:0⟫Everything’s going to be back to normal soon..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tout reviendra bientôt à la normale..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0423FDF5_FF77_4665_8471_0BFCAFBE6DA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 00461d15cbad4e6805d5b6ea573e7e26b1e893d512fea2cf3ceef95cb12a0dbe
