msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2BF65C28_D0EF_4D1A_8512_2F5231A14D79"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I would go to bed at night afraid I’d wake up the next morning...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and Nellie "
"wouldn’t."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫J’allais me coucher le soir avec la peur au ventre que je me réveille le lendemain matin..."
"⟪k:1⟫ sans Nellie."

#: scenario8:scenario8_758D1741_451D_42C8_8E0D_94FF9BF61F48
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 472f36c1b422487347383ef5a77d94c6d8ac076d5fd3e49e08afd14f6dd2d13a
#. default-sha256: 0449656ed07c59aa8e97c6833155aa78ad4d6d3c1eb22f672ac9ca5724d6fc78
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_758D1741_451D_42C8_8E0D_94FF9BF61F48"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And then one day, I heard whispers—⟪k:1⟫whispers of a witch who lived by the lake."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et puis un jour, j’ai entendu des rumeurs — des rumeurs selon lesquelles il y avait une "
"sorcière demeurant près du lac."

#: scenario8:scenario8_028B8958_691D_4F59_8716_03D9CB1616A1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5eb9e364b292568beb10cf3ffeba9b8d139bf13846821c7361bfd01a6dba8f1d
#. default-sha256: b204b5493bc063671b9616ddb954091aa2c0ec37388a3d7a29a899e64efb4198
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_028B8958_691D_4F59_8716_03D9CB1616A1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Seeing the thin trails of smoke rising from the chimney, I was convinced the rumors were "
"true. A witch lived in that house."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫J’aperçus de fines bandes de fumée qui s’élevaient de la cheminée, ce qui me confirma que "
"les rumeurs disaient vrai. Une sorcière vivait dans cette maison."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0A3DB912_0F1D_4E9B_BA67_426404BF8468
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b64a3cb799f74295eb9e5bf1cc30da1cd96d32debcc474cdc5781326d33f8132
#. default-sha256: 81f5a53e1055e05e1679837301e26c384996039dacd85f3651f81e71e2d1194b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0A3DB912_0F1D_4E9B_BA67_426404BF8468"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I wasn’t sure what to expect. Being a recluse, I figured she wasn’t going to be very "
"sociable, at least. ⟪k:1⟫To tell you the truth, I was kind of scared to knock on her door."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je ne savais pas trop à quoi m’attendre. Comme elle vivait à l’écart, je me disais qu’elle "
"ne serait pas très sociable, déjà. ⟪k:1⟫Pour être honnête, j’avais un peu peur de frapper à sa "
"porte."

#: scenario8:scenario8_9873A66F_9A39_4DE5_B2CA_8367360A0FCB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de8cc624674d8656b5ee653e15a4639b895380e162bfa5595a1c83d34f6dd7cf
#. default-sha256: 63b46d46060b03f9b48b85e871c107005649b3d0e6a99109328f31b3396bf9de
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9873A66F_9A39_4DE5_B2CA_8367360A0FCB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And even though she’d only said two words, there was something... ⟪k:1⟫indescribably "
"enchanting about that voice."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et même si elle n’avait prononcé que trois mots, il y avait quelque chose... ⟪k:1⟫"
"d’incroyablement enchanteur dans cette voix."

#: scenario8:scenario8_CCBC4967_FFFA_4687_85F8_B4D94E23F6B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f8bad86353cdcd09cba3bd7c1d2122d5ce9e2aa5be4aa6cbfc5e5048e921b24
