msgid "⟪k:0⟫...Who’s there?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...Qui est là ?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_0408CBB2_F9C7_4690_B5DD_06FB542FBEF8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2158f97aef8726e7e3cddfdae886e405e278a90e1df9ee079e29702a75c6b9d9
#. default-sha256: c5488c7ba0e6044061303672e145eb1ff7541a46c852a181e36bdddb5e0e24cc
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0408CBB2_F9C7_4690_B5DD_06FB542FBEF8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She repeated her question, which brought me back to reality, ⟪k:1⟫though I still had to "
"fight to maintain my wits enough to respond coherently."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elle répéta sa question, ce qui me ramena à la réalité, ⟪k:1⟫même si je peinais encore à "
"reprendre mes esprits pour répondre de façon cohérente."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2FB7C6B2_E1E4_40FD_9D03_BCD0FDDC7FD2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb0c29bfe8cdf38deb1dc76f4b305c2144f52c85f362310f4585f9bf3c5b1615
#. default-sha256: 7decfe8f931d8f6f2549ebbdd5e39c9ab4aaa94b2a9d3b1ea34845b0045041c8
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2FB7C6B2_E1E4_40FD_9D03_BCD0FDDC7FD2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ah, ⟪k:1⟫uh, ⟪k:2⟫she’s got an extremely high fever that won’t come down...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫She has "
"no appetite—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫she’s only drinking water—⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫and she can’t get out of bed..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ah, ⟪k:1⟫euh, ⟪k:2⟫elle a une fièvre extrêmement élevée qui ne veut pas descendre...⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫Elle n’a pas d’appétit —⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫ elle ne boit que de l’eau —⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫et elle ne peut "
"pas sortir du lit..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D1E81EE0_61A3_402A_BBA0_6E92397B5916
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
