msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Through our conversations, I managed to learn her name, as well as the fact that she had "
"come here from a faraway country. ⟪k:1⟫We were both a long way from home."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Lors de nos conversations, je réussis à connaître son nom et à apprendre qu’elle venait d’un "
"pays lointain. ⟪k:1⟫Nous étions tous les deux loin de chez nous."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E2A036F1_5F1D_4E75_BFE8_F62D13021E14
