msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but I ⟪k:1⟫do⟪k:2⟫ want to get to know you better.⟪k:3⟫I want to understand you.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫So "
"if you ever feel like talking about yourself,⟪k:6⟫just know that you’ve got an eager pair of ears "
