msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Four years ago... ⟪k:2⟫something unpleasant occurred.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫And as a result of "
"that... ⟪k:5⟫I was forced to part ways with the people who taught me that humans have the "
"capability for kindness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Il y a quatre ans... ⟪k:2⟫il m’est arrivé quelque chose de désagréable.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Et en "
"conséquence... ⟪k:5⟫j’ai été obligée de me séparer des gens qui m’ont enseigné que les humains "
"sont capables de bonté."

#: scenario8:scenario8_DBB42156_C174_445D_A1ED_64F0FE6AFE53
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
